(c) the details of pilot projects, procurement initiatives by Public Sector Oil Marketing Companies (OMC) and the estimated impact of large-scale DME adoption on LPG imports, employment generation and indigenous manufacturing under the Make in India initiative?

(a) whether Government has examined the smart on-site waste processing model recently introduced in Bengaluru and assessed its effectiveness in scientific waste management, reducing landfill burden and improving urban sanitation;
(b) whether Government proposes to replicate similar decentralised waste-processing systems in other metropolitan cities; and
(c) the details of financial, technical and institutional assistance proposed to be provided to Urban Local Bodies for adoption of such systems under various urban development and waste management schemes?

(a) whether Government is aware that Artificial Intelligence (AI) data centres are depleting groundwater in water-stressed cities like Bengaluru while farmers and citizens struggle for water;
