(a) whether Government has assessed the impact of toxic industrial effluents on rivers, groundwater, drinking water and agricultural land, including in Maharashtra and if so, the details thereof;
(b) whether heavy metals such as arsenic, lead, chromium, cadmium and nickel have been detected above permissible limits in major river basins during the last five years, and whether vulnerable villages have been identified;
