(d) the diplomatic, strategic and economic measures taken during the last five years to safeguard India's interests and leadership in the Indian Ocean Region?

(a) whether Government is aware that India continues to record one of the world's highest snakebite fatalities despite the availability of Anti-Snake Venom (ASV);
