(d) the measures being taken to strengthen ASV production, develop region-specific antivenoms, improve emergency treatment and achieve the target of reducing snakebite deaths by 2030?

(a) whether Government has assessed the need to mandate repair-friendly smartphones, including replaceable batteries, availability of spare parts, repair manuals and software support, in line with global best practices, to protect consumer interests and reduce electronic waste;
