(d) whether a city-wise utilisation and outcome audit of PMAY-Urban has been conducted to assess delivery, occupancy, delays and cost overruns?

(a) when Government will stop shielding airlines from sky-high ATF taxes, push sustainable fuels and force real hedging so passengers aren’t crushed by every global oil spike;
