(a) whether the Central Government has received proposals from the State Government of Maharashtra seeking central financial assistance for river-linking and major irrigation projects to make the State drought-free, including Daman Ganga–Ekdare–Godavari, Daman Ganga–Vaitarna–Godavari, Konkan–Godavari Basin, Nal Ganga–Wainganga and Par–Godavari projects and the present status of their approval and fund release;
